description	"Ailyn Vel

A relentless tracker and bounty hunter, driven by a lifelong vendetta against her father.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Cripples/Tracks On Hit
- Venom Coated Vibroknife (Purple Style Saber)
-- Poisons/Cripples/Staggers
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
- Thermal Grenades (2)
-- Inflicts Flame/Tracking/Cripple
-- 100% More Damage

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor (1)
- Healing (2)
- Dexterity (2)
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Strength (1)
- Force Sense Immunity

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Grav-Laser (Pulls on hit) ^3[CS3]
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS2]
- Inhibitor Darts (Tracking Darts 12) ^3[Melee CS4]
-- Cripples/Poisons On Hit
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]"